# The generated PDFs, from scripts/make-corpus.ts. Deterministic, so there is nothing to
# gain from committing 40 of them.
#
# The leading slash matters and its absence cost a failed deploy: `corpus/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, so it silently excluded src/lib/corpus/ as well.
# `git add -A` skipped the file, `git status` stayed clean, and the build passed locally
# because the file was still on disk — it only surfaced on a fresh clone.
/corpus/

*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

.DS_Store
*.log
